WEBVTT

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:13.647
WHAT IS REALITY?

00:00:15.183 --> 00:00:16.450
HIPPIE GUY.

00:00:16.484 --> 00:00:18.752
THE OBSERVABLE UNIVERSE?

00:00:18.786 --> 00:00:20.421
I SUPPOSE THAT ANSWER MIGHT FLY
IN THE PHYSICS DEPARTMENT,

00:00:20.454 --> 00:00:22.156
BUT THIS IS NEUROSCIENCE.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:25.826
WHO'S GOT THE BRAINS TO GIVE ME
AN ANSWER RELATING TO THE BRAIN?

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.161
IRONIC T-SHIRT.

00:00:27.195 --> 00:00:28.496
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:31.199
REALITY IS EXACTLY
WHAT WE SEE AND HEAR,

00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:34.135
INSTEAD OF WHAT WE FANTASIZE
ABOUT OR DREAM

00:00:34.168 --> 00:00:36.437
OR, YOU KNOW,
MAYBE HALLUCINATE.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:39.140
AH. HALLUCINATION.

00:00:39.173 --> 00:00:42.143
THAT'S AN ANSWER I WOULD HAVE
EXPECTED FROM HIPPIE GUY.

00:00:42.176 --> 00:00:43.477
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:00:43.511 --> 00:00:46.580
SEX, DRUGS,
AND ROCK 'N' ROLL, RIGHT?

00:00:46.614 --> 00:00:48.549
OKAY. NOW, HERE'S SOMETHING
THAT'S REALLY

00:00:48.582 --> 00:00:49.950
GONNA ALTER YOUR CONSCIOUSNESS.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:52.953
REALITY...

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:55.589
IS A FIGMENT
OF YOUR IMAGINATION.

00:00:55.623 --> 00:01:00.594
WHO HERE HASN'T WOKEN UP
BREATHLESS FROM A NIGHTMARE

00:01:00.628 --> 00:01:03.297
AND THOUGHT, "OH,
THANK GOD IT'S JUST A DREAM"?

00:01:03.331 --> 00:01:06.567
THAT'S BECAUSE
THE NEUROCHEMICAL IMPULSES

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.837
FIRED WHEN WE'RE DREAMING
OR FANTASIZING

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:12.906
OR HALLUCINATING
ARE INDISTINGUISHABLE

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:15.209
FROM THE ONES BANGING AROUND
INSIDE OUR SKULLS

00:01:15.243 --> 00:01:17.311
WHEN WE ACTUALLY EXPERIENCE
THOSE EVENTS.

00:01:17.345 --> 00:01:20.114
SO...

00:01:20.148 --> 00:01:25.553
IF WHAT WE PERCEIVE
IS OFTEN WRONG...

00:01:25.586 --> 00:01:30.124
HOW CAN WE EVER KNOW WHAT'S REAL
AND WHAT ISN'T?

00:01:34.362 --> 00:01:36.397
ALL RIGHT.
FACULTY MEETING'S AT NOON.

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:38.199
ROSENTHAL'S AT 2:00,

00:01:38.232 --> 00:01:40.434
SO I PICKED YOU UP ONE OF
THE VEGGIE WRAPS THAT YOU LIKE.

00:01:40.468 --> 00:01:42.370
YOU CAN SCARF IT DOWN
IN BETWEEN.

00:01:42.403 --> 00:01:43.704
YOU KNOW HOW YOU GET
WHEN YOU DON'T EAT.

00:01:43.737 --> 00:01:45.239
LYEAH?I.

00:01:45.273 --> 00:01:46.574
ROOM AND BOARD IN EXCHANGE
FOR SOME LIGHT HOUSEKEEPING

00:01:46.607 --> 00:01:47.875
DOES NOT MAKE YOU
MY MOTHER.

00:01:47.908 --> 00:01:48.742
JUST TRYING TO LOOK OUT
FOR YOU, DOC.

00:01:48.776 --> 00:01:50.411
DO YOU HAVE MY PUZZLES?

00:01:50.444 --> 00:01:52.246
YEAH. TIMES, CHRONICLE, TRIB,
DAILY MAIL...

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:53.747
PROFESSOR PIERCE?

00:01:53.781 --> 00:01:55.649
I WAS WONDERING
IF I COULD BUY YOU A LATTE.

00:01:55.683 --> 00:01:58.719
UH,
I DON'T DRINK COFFEE.

00:01:58.752 --> 00:02:01.755
OH, IT DOESN'T
HAVE TO BE COFFEE.

00:02:01.789 --> 00:02:04.425
I JUST WANTED TO PICK YOUR BRAIN
ABOUT MY TERM-PAPER TOPIC.

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:07.261
OH. [ CHUCKLES ]
HERE'S THE THING, MISS...

00:02:07.295 --> 00:02:09.263
KARYN. UH...

00:02:09.297 --> 00:02:12.065
"DISCUSSING YOUR TERM PAPER"
IS OBVIOUSLY CODE FOR SEX.

00:02:12.099 --> 00:02:15.169
AND -- AND WHILE WE MIGHT BOTH
ENJOY THAT VERY MUCH,

00:02:15.203 --> 00:02:17.070
IT COULD ALSO GET ME FIRED,

00:02:17.104 --> 00:02:19.440
SO I'M AFRAID
I HAVE TO REGRETFULLY

00:02:19.473 --> 00:02:21.909
AND RESPECTFULLY
DECLINE YOUR OFFER.

00:02:27.281 --> 00:02:29.250
PIG.

00:02:29.283 --> 00:02:31.285
[ CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:02:41.795 --> 00:02:44.798
DANIEL.

00:02:44.832 --> 00:02:46.467
[ MUSIC CONTINUES ]

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.968
DANIEL.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:51.972
KATE MORETTI.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:55.309
YOU'D BE A LOT EASIER TO FIND
IF YOU CARRIED A CELLPHONE.

00:02:55.343 --> 00:02:57.110
IF I CARRIED A CELLPHONE,
THE GOVERNMENT COULD TRACK ME.

00:02:57.144 --> 00:02:59.112
IMY POINT EXACTLY.T.

00:03:00.314 --> 00:03:02.483
I THOUGHT
YOU WERE AT QUANTICO.

00:03:02.516 --> 00:03:03.817
GOT MY OLD DESK BACK.

00:03:03.851 --> 00:03:05.286
ISN'T THAT A DEMOTION?

00:03:05.319 --> 00:03:08.322
GOT A FEW MINUTES?

00:03:10.324 --> 00:03:11.492
HIS NAME'S CLARK WEILMAN.

00:03:11.525 --> 00:03:12.993
HE'S -- WELL, HE WAS

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:15.429
GENERAL COUNSEL
OF TechSan PHARMACEUTICALS.

00:03:15.463 --> 00:03:17.365
SKULL WAS FRACTURED
IN SIX PLACES,

00:03:17.398 --> 00:03:19.467
AND HIS WIFE CONFESSED
TO DETECTIVES

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:20.534
FROM CHICAGO HOMICIDE.

00:03:20.568 --> 00:03:21.935
POLICE HAVE A CONFESSION.

00:03:21.969 --> 00:03:23.804
WHY AM I LOOKING
AT THESE PRETTY PICTURES?

00:03:23.837 --> 00:03:25.639
WIFE MAKES NICOLE RICHIE
LOOK FAT.

00:03:25.673 --> 00:03:27.441
I DON'T KNOW
WHO THAT IS.

00:03:27.475 --> 00:03:30.811
I-I THINK THE WIFE HAS ANOREXIA
OR BULIMIA. I DON'T KNOW.

00:03:30.844 --> 00:03:32.713
EITHER WAY,
SHE COULD NOT LIFT THIS TROPHY,

00:03:32.746 --> 00:03:35.316
LET ALONE BASH HER HUSBAND
OVER THE HEAD WITH IT SIX TIMES.

00:03:35.349 --> 00:03:36.850
YOU THINK THE CONFESSION
WAS COERCED?

00:03:36.884 --> 00:03:38.185
SHE HAS A VACANT AFFECT.

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:40.020
IF SHE DOES HAVE
AN EATING DISORDER,

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:42.690
IT COULD BE A SYMPTOM OF A MUCH
MORE SERIOUS MENTAL ILLNESS.

00:03:42.723 --> 00:03:45.759
YOU WERE ALWAYS
ONE OF MY BEST STUDENTS.

00:03:48.696 --> 00:03:51.064
W-WHY IS THE FBI INVOLVED
IN THIS ANYWAY?

00:03:51.098 --> 00:03:54.001
A COUPLE OF MONTHS AGO,
TechSan INFORMED THE BUREAU

00:03:54.034 --> 00:03:57.371
THAT SOME OF ITS TOP EXECUTIVES
WERE RECEIVING DEATH THREATS,

00:03:57.405 --> 00:03:59.540
CALLING THE PHARMACEUTICAL
INDUSTRY

00:03:59.573 --> 00:04:01.875
PART OF A VAST
PUBLIC/PRIVATE CONSPIRACY

00:04:01.909 --> 00:04:03.777
TO POISON
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE.

00:04:03.811 --> 00:04:05.679
[ SCOFFS ]
CAN'T ARGUE WITH THAT.

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:11.985
S.A.I.C. SAYS YOU GAVE UP
THE CONSULTING GIG.

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:13.487
ANY PARTICULAR REASON?

00:04:13.521 --> 00:04:15.489
OH, UH...

00:04:15.523 --> 00:04:17.190
AFTER YOU LEFT,
THE FUN WENT OUT OF IT.

00:04:17.224 --> 00:04:19.092
WELL, I'M BACK.

00:04:23.831 --> 00:04:28.502
WHY DID YOU KILL YOUR HUSBAND,
MRS. WEILMAN?

00:04:28.536 --> 00:04:29.670
[ SIGHS ]

00:04:29.703 --> 00:04:30.804
I, UH...

00:04:32.606 --> 00:04:35.242
...DON'T KNOW.

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:41.248
YOU TOLD THE POLICE YOU WANTED
THE INSURANCE MONEY.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:44.752
YES. THAT'S -- THAT'S RIGHT,
THE INSURANCE MONEY.

00:04:44.785 --> 00:04:47.755
AND JUST WHAT IS
THE POINT OF THIS?

00:04:47.788 --> 00:04:51.224
WHEN DID YOU AND YOUR HUSBAND
BUY THIS POLICY?

00:04:51.258 --> 00:04:53.861
[ Voice breaking ]
I DON'T REMEMBER.

00:04:55.963 --> 00:04:57.765
WAS IT LAST THURSDAY?

00:04:57.798 --> 00:04:59.833
YOU MET YOUR HUSBAND
FOR LUNCH,

00:04:59.867 --> 00:05:02.936
AND THEN YOU BOTH WENT TO
THE INSURANCE-COMPANY OFFICES

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:04.405
AND SIGNED THE PAPERS?

00:05:04.438 --> 00:05:09.943
YEAH. THAT'S RIGHT.
IT WAS...YEAH.

00:05:10.978 --> 00:05:14.114
TWO DAYS AGO,
WHEN YOU WENT FOR A WALK,

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:16.584
DID YOU FIND
A STRAY KITTEN?

00:05:16.617 --> 00:05:19.420
YOU TOOK HER HOME?
YOU CALLED HER MILLIE?

00:05:19.453 --> 00:05:23.256
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:27.361
HOW DID YOU KNOW
ABOUT MILLIE?

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:33.801
SHE'S INNOCENT.

00:05:33.834 --> 00:05:35.569
WHAT ARE YOU TALKING ABOUT?
SHE SIGNED A CONFESSION.

00:05:35.603 --> 00:05:37.638
THAT'S BECAUSE SHE'S SUFFERING
FROM KORSAKOFF'S SYNDROME.

00:05:37.671 --> 00:05:39.473
IT'S A NEUROLOGICAL DISORDER

00:05:39.507 --> 00:05:41.642
CHARACTERIZED
BY ANTEROGRADE AMNESIA,

00:05:41.675 --> 00:05:44.277
EXTREME SUSCEPTIBILITY TO
SUGGESTION, AND CONFABULATION.

00:05:44.311 --> 00:05:45.613
I TELL HER SHE HAS A CAT
NAMED MILLIE,

00:05:45.646 --> 00:05:47.147
SHE REMEMBERS
HAVING A CAT NAMED MILLIE.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.082
YOU TELL HER SHE BASHED
HER HUSBAND OVER THE HEAD

00:05:49.116 --> 00:05:50.984
WITH A GOLF TROPHY,
AND SHE REMEMBERS THAT.

00:05:51.018 --> 00:05:52.986
ONLY THERE IS NO CAT.
I MADE THAT UP.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.455
JUST LIKE YOU MADE UP
A STORY

00:05:54.488 --> 00:05:56.156
ABOUT A MURDER PLOT
TO COLLECT LIFE INSURANCE,

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:58.659
WHICH IS A BIT OF A CLICHé,
ISN'T IT, DETECTIVE?

00:05:58.692 --> 00:06:02.396
WHAT THE [BLEEP]
HEY, HOLD ON A SECOND!

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:03.764
HEY! HEY!

00:06:03.797 --> 00:06:05.466
LISTEN,
WE DID A BACKGROUND CHECK.

00:06:05.499 --> 00:06:08.301
WE FOUND OUT ABOUT THAT POLICY,
AND WE ASKED HER.

00:06:08.335 --> 00:06:09.970
YOU'RE ACTING LIKE I BEAT IT OUT
OF HER WITH A RUBBER HOSE.

00:06:10.003 --> 00:06:11.505
EITHER WAY,
IT'S A FALSE CONFESSION.

00:06:11.539 --> 00:06:12.973
SHE DOESN'T BELONG IN JAIL.
SHE BELONGS IN A HOSPITAL.

00:06:13.006 --> 00:06:14.975
[ SCOFFS ]
THIS IS [BLEEP]

00:06:15.008 --> 00:06:16.176
CAN WE GO NOW?

00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:19.413
JUST GIVE ME A MINUTE.
OKAY?

00:06:19.447 --> 00:06:22.015
I'M GONNA RECOMMEND THAT
MS. WEILMAN BE TRANSFERRED

00:06:22.049 --> 00:06:24.384
TO A PSYCHIATRIC UNIT
FOR FURTHER EVALUATION.

00:06:24.418 --> 00:06:27.387
ARE YOU KIDDING ME?!
SHE CONFESSED TO MURDER.

00:06:27.421 --> 00:06:29.056
[ INDISTINCT SHOUTING ]

00:06:29.089 --> 00:06:30.190
[ KEYBOARD CLACKING LOUDLY ]

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:31.825
LOOK, IF DR. PIERCE...

00:06:31.859 --> 00:06:33.293
[ POLICE RADIO CHATTER ]

00:06:33.326 --> 00:06:34.895
[ INDISTINCT CONVERSATION ]

00:06:34.928 --> 00:06:36.730
[ HOLE PUNCHER SLAMMING ]

00:06:36.764 --> 00:06:38.699
MY LIEUTENANT WARNED ME
ABOUT YOU,

00:06:38.732 --> 00:06:40.501
SAID YOU'D COME IN HERE,
FLASHING YOUR FBI BADGE,

00:06:40.534 --> 00:06:42.436
JACKING OUR CASES.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.937
SCREWING WITH ONE
OF MINE NOW

00:06:43.971 --> 00:06:45.939
BECAUSE SOME NUTJOB
MAKES A DRIVE-BY DIAGNOSIS?

00:06:45.973 --> 00:06:48.241
HE'S NOT A NUTJOB,
DETECTIVE HAMMOND.

00:06:48.275 --> 00:06:51.411
HE LITERALLY WROTE THE BOOK
ON FORENSIC NEUROPSYCHIATRY --

00:06:51.445 --> 00:06:52.746
FOUR OF THEM, ACTUALLY.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:55.282
NOT A NUTJOB, HUH?

00:06:59.787 --> 00:07:03.056
OKAY. SO HE'S
A LITTLE ECCENTRIC.

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.793
[ CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:07:19.873 --> 00:07:22.876
TAKES ONE OF US TURNING UP DEAD
TO GET THE FBI's INTEREST?

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.678
YOU'LL HAVE TO FORGIVE ALAN,
AGENT MORETTI.

00:07:24.712 --> 00:07:26.179
HE AND CLARK
WERE VERY CLOSE.

00:07:26.213 --> 00:07:27.848
AND NOW THAT HE'S GONE,

00:07:27.881 --> 00:07:30.283
YOU'LL BE TAKING OVER HIS JOB
AS GENERAL COUNSEL.

00:07:30.317 --> 00:07:31.284
WHAT ARE YOU IMPLYING?

00:07:31.318 --> 00:07:32.620
NOTHING AT ALL.

00:07:32.653 --> 00:07:34.988
I JUST NEED ACCESS
TO ALL LITIGATION

00:07:35.022 --> 00:07:37.057
FILED AGAINST TechSan
OVER THE PAST FIVE YEARS.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.059
DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA
HOW MANY FRIVOLOUS CLAIMS

00:07:39.092 --> 00:07:40.761
A COMPANY LIKE OURS
HAS TO DEAL WITH?

00:07:40.794 --> 00:07:42.429
MM. I CAN IMAGINE.

00:07:42.462 --> 00:07:44.865
BUT WE MAY BE ABLE TO CONNECT
THE DEATH THREATS

00:07:44.898 --> 00:07:47.400
TechSan RECEIVED TO SOMEONE
WHO BROUGHT A LAWSUIT

00:07:47.434 --> 00:07:49.069
AGAINST THE COMPANY.

00:07:49.102 --> 00:07:51.505
AND I WOULD ALSO LIKE ACCESS
TO MR. WEILMAN'S E-MAIL ACCOUNT

00:07:51.539 --> 00:07:54.107
AND A LIST OF HIS CURRENT
AND FORMER COLLEAGUES --

00:07:54.141 --> 00:07:56.143
REALLY, ANYONE HE CAME
INTO CONTACT WITH.

00:07:56.176 --> 00:07:58.278
ALAN WILL GET YOU EVERYTHING
YOU NEED.

00:08:02.182 --> 00:08:03.851
THANKS, ALAN.]

00:08:11.659 --> 00:08:13.961
DAMAGE TO
THE MEDIAL THALAMUS.

00:08:13.994 --> 00:08:17.798
BLEEDING IN
THE MAMMILLARY BODIES.

00:08:17.831 --> 00:08:20.033
GENERALIZED
CEREBRAL ATROPHY.

00:08:20.067 --> 00:08:23.036
ALL OF WHICH WOULD RESULT
IN EXTREME THIAMINE DEFICIENCY.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:26.740
MANIFEST AS KORSAKOFF'S.
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:08:26.774 --> 00:08:28.508
THE GREAT DANIEL PIERCE
STRIKES AGAIN.

00:08:28.542 --> 00:08:30.343
THANK YOU, HARVEY.

00:08:30.377 --> 00:08:32.245
QUESTION IS,
HOW DID MRS. WEILMAN

00:08:32.279 --> 00:08:33.413
LOSE SO MUCH THIAMINE?

00:08:33.446 --> 00:08:34.682
MAYBE SHE'S A BIG DRINKER.

00:08:34.715 --> 00:08:35.816
OR A BIG PUKER.

00:08:35.849 --> 00:08:37.050
COULD BE BULIMIA.

00:08:37.084 --> 00:08:38.318
OR MAYBE
SHE'S JUST A BEANPOLE.

00:08:38.351 --> 00:08:40.253
THAT'S YOUR DIAGNOSIS?
BEANPOLE?

00:08:40.287 --> 00:08:44.057
CHRONIC BEANPOLE SYNDROME?

00:08:44.091 --> 00:08:48.528
DANIEL?
GOT A FEW MORE MINUTES?

00:08:50.964 --> 00:08:53.801
THESE ARE THE ANONYMOUS E-MAILS
SENT TO CLARK WEILMAN

00:08:53.834 --> 00:08:55.535
AND THE OTHER
TechSan EXECUTIVES.

00:08:55.569 --> 00:08:57.771
THESE DEATH THREATS WERE ROUTED
THROUGH SERVERS

00:08:57.805 --> 00:08:59.172
ALL OVER THE WORLD.

00:08:59.206 --> 00:09:00.941
WHOEVER SENT THEM KNOWS
HOW TO COVER HIS TRACKS.

00:09:00.974 --> 00:09:03.076
ANYTHING YOU CAN TELL US
ABOUT THE PSYCHOLOGY

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:04.678
OF THE LETTER WRITER
WOULD HELP.

00:09:04.712 --> 00:09:07.180
"PHARMACEUTICAL INDUSTRY
AND THE FDA

00:09:07.214 --> 00:09:09.850
ARE CONSPIRING TO KEEP
THE AMERICAN PEOPLE SICK."

00:09:09.883 --> 00:09:11.785
WELL, THAT PART'S
CERTAINLY TRUE.

00:09:11.819 --> 00:09:12.786
IS HE SERIOUS?

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.221
RESTLESS LEG SYNDROME?

00:09:14.254 --> 00:09:15.589
YOU DON'T THINK
THAT'S AN INVENTION

00:09:15.623 --> 00:09:16.857
OF THE DRUG COMPANIES
TO SELL MORE PILLS?

00:09:19.927 --> 00:09:21.895
"YOU SCUM NEED
A HEARTY REMINDER."

00:09:21.929 --> 00:09:23.864
THAT'S REPEATED IN EACH
OF THE E-MAILS.

00:09:23.897 --> 00:09:25.498
YOU THINK
IT MEANS SOMETHING?

00:09:25.532 --> 00:09:27.367
"YOU SCUM NEED
A HEARTY REMINDER."

00:09:44.351 --> 00:09:45.653
"TechSan..."

00:09:47.655 --> 00:09:51.558
"...MURDERED...IRENE MAY."

00:09:51.591 --> 00:09:52.893
IT'S AN ANAGRAM.

00:09:52.926 --> 00:09:54.561
[ SCOFFS ]

00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:56.830
SOME DOMESTIC TERRORIST
GOES TO ALL THIS TROUBLE

00:09:56.864 --> 00:09:58.632
TO DISGUISE THE SOURCE
OF HIS E-MAILS,

00:09:58.666 --> 00:10:00.901
AND THEN HE JUST
GIVES US A NAME?

00:10:00.934 --> 00:10:02.402
HE'S TRYING TO PROVE
HE'S SMARTER THAN WE ARE.

00:10:02.435 --> 00:10:04.071
VERY GOOD,
AGENT MORETTI.

00:10:04.104 --> 00:10:07.140
"MAY v. TechSan,
DISMISSED IN SUMMARY JUDGMENT,

00:10:07.174 --> 00:10:10.377
FILED BY A TIMOTHY MAY ON BEHALF
OF HIS MOTHER, IRENE."

00:10:13.146 --> 00:10:15.282
I'VE GOT AN ADDRESS.

00:10:15.315 --> 00:10:17.050
WANT TO TAKE A RIDE?

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.155
WAIT HERE.

00:10:22.189 --> 00:10:25.158
ONCE IT'S CLEAR, YOU CAN
COME UP, TAKE A LOOK AROUND.

00:10:25.192 --> 00:10:26.293
[ POUNDING ON DOOR ]

00:10:26.326 --> 00:10:27.828
MR. MAY?

00:10:30.764 --> 00:10:34.935
FBI! WE'D LIKE TO TALK
TO YOU!

00:10:37.204 --> 00:10:39.206
OPEN IT.

00:10:56.990 --> 00:10:58.959
[ DOOR CLOSES ]

00:10:58.992 --> 00:11:02.462
[ GUN COCKS ]

00:11:02.495 --> 00:11:04.597
MR. MAY?

00:11:13.874 --> 00:11:15.342
[ CLATTER ]

00:11:15.375 --> 00:11:18.211
FBI! STOP!
STAIRS!

00:11:24.617 --> 00:11:26.754
FREEZE, MR. MAY!

00:11:32.259 --> 00:11:34.828
[ GRUNTS ]

00:11:34.862 --> 00:11:36.396
[ GROANS ]

00:11:38.832 --> 00:11:40.300
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?!

00:11:40.333 --> 00:11:41.601
FINE.

00:11:41.634 --> 00:11:43.170
YOU WANT
MY PROFESSIONAL OPINION,

00:11:43.203 --> 00:11:45.005
JUMPING OFF
A SECOND-STORY FIRE ESCAPE

00:11:45.038 --> 00:11:46.606
IS WHAT WE COMMONLY
CALL "CRAZY."

00:11:46.639 --> 00:11:49.676
GUESS THAT MAKES
TWO OF US.

00:12:03.791 --> 00:12:06.760
IT'S NOT AGAINST THE LAW
TO SEND E-MAILS.

00:12:06.794 --> 00:12:09.196
IT'S AGAINST THE LAW TO MAKE
TERRORIST THREATS.

00:12:09.229 --> 00:12:11.131
AND MURDER IS KIND OF
A NO-NO, TOO.

00:12:11.164 --> 00:12:12.399
I DIDN'T KILL ANYONE.

00:12:12.432 --> 00:12:13.967
THEN I WILL ASK
YOU AGAIN --

00:12:14.001 --> 00:12:16.269
WHERE WERE YOU THE NIGHT
THAT CLARK WEILMAN DIED?

00:12:16.303 --> 00:12:18.839
YOU THINK I'M GONNA COOPERATE
WITH THE BEAST BETTER KNOWN

00:12:18.872 --> 00:12:20.774
AS THE UNITED STATES
FEDERAL GOVERNMENT?

00:12:20.808 --> 00:12:22.275
Daniel: HERBALWHAT?

00:12:22.309 --> 00:12:23.710
NO MILK, NO SUGAR.

00:12:26.814 --> 00:12:29.116
NO SUGAR?

00:12:38.458 --> 00:12:40.093
PROCESSED SUGAR --

00:12:40.127 --> 00:12:43.230
THAT'S AN ADDICTIVE DRUG
PEDDLED BY BIG AGRIBUSINESS

00:12:43.263 --> 00:12:46.233
TO PROMOTE AN EPIDEMIC
IN TYPE 2 DIABETES.

00:12:48.568 --> 00:12:50.203
AND THEN THEIR PALS
IN BIG PHARMA

00:12:50.237 --> 00:12:52.372
CAN REAP BILLIONS
MARKETING TREATMENTS.

00:12:52.405 --> 00:12:54.307
AND DON'T EVEN
GET ME STARTED

00:12:54.341 --> 00:12:56.543
ON WHY THEY PUT HORMONES
IN MILK.

00:12:56.576 --> 00:12:57.577
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:12:59.312 --> 00:13:01.048
I-I'M NOT A FED,
BY THE WAY.

00:13:01.081 --> 00:13:03.283
THEN WHAT ARE YOU
DOING HERE?

00:13:03.316 --> 00:13:06.219
COLLEGE PROFESSOR.
[ SCOFFS ]

00:13:06.253 --> 00:13:09.022
SOMETIMES THEY ASK
FOR MY EXPERT OPINION.

00:13:09.056 --> 00:13:13.026
AND I-I BILL THE BEAST FOR MY --
FOR MY TIME, BELIEVE ME.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.795
FIGURE AS LONG AS THEY'RE
GONNA BLEED ME WITH TAXES,

00:13:15.829 --> 00:13:17.797
MIGHT AS WELL GET SOMETHING
OUT OF IT, RIGHT?

00:13:17.831 --> 00:13:19.833
[ SCOFFS ]

00:13:19.867 --> 00:13:21.634
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:13:21.668 --> 00:13:25.538
YOUR MOTHER HAD TYPE 2 DIABETES,
DIDN'T SHE?

00:13:25.572 --> 00:13:30.610
SHE WAS ALWAYS SENDING ME OUT
TO PICK HER UP SODA, ICE CREAM.

00:13:32.445 --> 00:13:35.315
I SHOULD HAVE TOLD HER NO.

00:13:35.348 --> 00:13:39.619
WELL, SHE WAS YOUR MOM.
YOU WANTED TO MAKE HER HAPPY.

00:13:39.652 --> 00:13:42.789
AND YOU --
YOU WANTED TO HELP HER.

00:13:42.822 --> 00:13:44.291
THAT'S WHY YOU SIGNED HER UP
FOR A DRUG TRIAL.

00:13:44.324 --> 00:13:45.592
IS THAT RIGHT?

00:13:45.625 --> 00:13:48.595
TechSan'S NEW MIRACLE PILL,
INSULPRIN?

00:13:48.628 --> 00:13:51.999
THEY SAID
IT WOULD CURE HER.

00:13:52.032 --> 00:13:54.067
INSTEAD, SHE DROPS DEAD
OF A HEART ATTACK.

00:13:54.101 --> 00:13:55.368
YOU THINK
THE DRUG KILLED HER?

00:13:55.402 --> 00:13:56.870
IT'S POISON.

00:13:59.839 --> 00:14:01.841
AND THE BIG-SHOT LAWYERS
AT TechSan

00:14:01.875 --> 00:14:03.276
HAVE YOUR SUIT THROWN OUT.

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.945
THEY SAID
IT WAS FRIVOLOUS.

00:14:04.978 --> 00:14:06.446
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:14:06.479 --> 00:14:08.848
[BLEEP] WOULDN'T EVEN PAY
FOR THE FUNERAL.

00:14:08.882 --> 00:14:10.783
THAT MUST HAVE MADE YOU
PRETTY ANGRY.

00:14:10.817 --> 00:14:14.021
YOU GOT NO IDEA.

00:14:14.054 --> 00:14:17.357
ANGRY ENOUGH
TO KILL CLARK WEILMAN?

00:14:20.127 --> 00:14:21.628
LOOK AT ME, MISTER.

00:14:24.731 --> 00:14:28.902
YOU REALLY THINK I GOT IT IN ME
TO CAVE SOME GUY'S HEAD IN?

00:14:36.443 --> 00:14:38.611
DRWHAT ABOUT THE CASE?S.

00:14:38.645 --> 00:14:40.413
YOU HELPED US SOLVE IT.
THANK YOU.

00:14:40.447 --> 00:14:43.050
YOU DON'T REALLY BELIEVE
THAT POOR GUY KILLED ANYBODY?

00:14:43.083 --> 00:14:45.352
NO. HE'S PARANOID.
HE'S NOT VIOLENT. I AGREE.

00:14:45.385 --> 00:14:46.653
AND WE HAVE
NO PHYSICAL EVIDENCE

00:14:46.686 --> 00:14:48.288
CONNECTING HIM
TO THE CRIME SCENE.

00:14:48.321 --> 00:14:50.223
W-WAIT -- I'M TOLD I CAN BE
A LITTLE ABSENTMINDED,

00:14:50.257 --> 00:14:52.125
SO MAYBE I'M MISSING
SOMETHING HERE.

00:14:52.159 --> 00:14:54.494
WE WERE ASSIGNED TO INVESTIGATE
TERRORIST THREATS.

00:14:54.527 --> 00:14:56.429
WE HAVE THE MAN WHO MADE
THOSE THREATS IN CUSTODY.

00:14:56.463 --> 00:14:57.897
BUT THERE WAS A MURDER!

00:14:57.931 --> 00:14:59.132
LOCAL POLICE MATTER.

00:14:59.166 --> 00:15:00.667
OH, COME ON.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.335
YOU DANGLE A PUZZLE LIKE THIS
IN FRONT OF ME,

00:15:02.369 --> 00:15:04.938
AND YOU EXPECT ME TO DROP IT
BEFORE IT'S SOLVED?

00:15:04.972 --> 00:15:07.740
LISTEN...

00:15:07.774 --> 00:15:10.643
YOU WERE RIGHT, OKAY?

00:15:10.677 --> 00:15:13.413
MY TRANSFER BACK TO CHICAGO
WAS A DEMOTION.

00:15:13.446 --> 00:15:15.082
WHAT'D YOU DO?

00:15:15.115 --> 00:15:16.449
LEAP OFF ONE TOO MANY
TALL BUILDINGS

00:15:16.483 --> 00:15:17.850
IN PURSUIT
OF FLEEING SUSPECTS?

00:15:17.884 --> 00:15:20.853
THE DEPUTY DIRECTOR SAID
THAT I HAD A TENDENCY

00:15:20.887 --> 00:15:24.324
TO GO BEYOND THE SCOPE OF
MY ASSIGNED INVESTIGATIONS.

00:15:24.357 --> 00:15:27.194
WELL, YOU CAN TRY TO BE
A GOOD LITTLE BUREAUCRAT

00:15:27.227 --> 00:15:28.661
AND DENY YOUR IMPULSES,

00:15:28.695 --> 00:15:31.031
BUT YOU KNOW YOU'RE JUST
AS INCAPABLE

00:15:31.064 --> 00:15:32.899
OF LETTING THIS GO
AS I AM.

00:15:34.901 --> 00:15:38.871
THANK YOU FOR SEEING US,
DR. BRYANT.

00:15:38.905 --> 00:15:40.340
I DON'T KNOW HOW MUCH HELP
I CAN BE.

00:15:40.373 --> 00:15:41.674
I-I DIDN'T KNOW
CLARK WELL.

00:15:41.708 --> 00:15:44.177
LAWYERS DON'T MIX MUCH
WITH LAB RATS.

00:15:44.211 --> 00:15:46.113
WELL, WE'VE BEEN TALKING
TO EVERYONE

00:15:46.146 --> 00:15:47.447
MR. WEILMAN
HAD CONTACT WITH --

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.382
UH, FRIENDS, ASSOCIATES
HERE AT TechSan.

00:15:49.416 --> 00:15:52.452
DOES YOUR NEW BLOCKBUSTER DRUG,
INSULPRIN, CAUSE HEART ATTACKS?

00:15:55.922 --> 00:15:57.424
HOW IS THAT RELEVANT?

00:15:57.457 --> 00:16:00.860
UH, NO, THAT'S OKAY.
I'M HAPPY TO ANSWER THAT.

00:16:00.893 --> 00:16:02.295
INSULPRIN...

00:16:02.329 --> 00:16:05.298
HAS BEEN RIGOROUSLY TESTED
FOR FIVE YEARS.

00:16:05.332 --> 00:16:06.866
SUBJECTS TAKING THE DRUG

00:16:06.899 --> 00:16:08.435
ARE CERTAINLY NO MORE LIKELY
TO HAVE HEART ATTACKS

00:16:08.468 --> 00:16:09.736
THAN THE CONTROL GROUP.

00:16:09.769 --> 00:16:11.704
WE'RE VERY PROUD
OF INSULPRIN HERE.

00:16:11.738 --> 00:16:13.473
IT'S GONNA SAVE
A LOT OF LIVES.

00:16:13.506 --> 00:16:15.742
[ SCOFFS ]
AND EARN BILLIONS OF DOLLARS.

00:16:15.775 --> 00:16:17.744
W-WHAT DOES ANY OF THIS HAVE TO
DO WITH CLARK WEILMAN'S MURDER?

00:16:17.777 --> 00:16:19.746
THERE WAS A LAWSUIT
FILED AGAINST THIS COMPANY

00:16:19.779 --> 00:16:21.748
BY A MAN CLAIMING
HIS MOTHER'S CORONARY

00:16:21.781 --> 00:16:23.750
WAS CAUSED BY INSULPRIN,
MAYBE TechSan.

00:16:23.783 --> 00:16:25.418
YEAH.
I REMEMBER THAT SUIT.

00:16:25.452 --> 00:16:27.154
IT WAS DISMISSED
IN SUMMA[ CHUCKLES ]

00:16:27.187 --> 00:16:28.755
SOMETHING FUNNY?

00:16:28.788 --> 00:16:31.258
SAD, ACTUALLY.

00:16:31.291 --> 00:16:34.427
UM, I REMEMBER IT, TOO,
BECAUSE IT TURNS OUT

00:16:34.461 --> 00:16:36.763
THIS MAY WOMAN
WAS IN THE PLACEBO GROUP.

00:16:36.796 --> 00:16:38.831
SHE WASN'T EVEN TAKING
THE DRUG.

00:16:38.865 --> 00:16:40.967
THAT ANSWER
YOUR QUESTION?

00:16:48.541 --> 00:16:50.610
Kate: DANIEL?

00:16:50.643 --> 00:16:53.046
DANIEL, ARE YOU OKAY?

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.448
HMM.

00:16:55.482 --> 00:16:57.617
WELL, I APPRECIATE YOUR MAYBE
NOT-SO-HEALTHY DISTRUST

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:59.352
OF LARGE INSTITUTIONS,

00:16:59.386 --> 00:17:01.121
BUT HOW ABOUT WE JUST PUT ASIDE
YOUR CONSPIRACY THEORIES

00:17:01.154 --> 00:17:02.789
AND FOCUS ON FINDING
THE KILLER?

00:17:02.822 --> 00:17:04.957
I'M LOOKING
FOR A VALERIE NELSON!

00:17:04.991 --> 00:17:06.025
HAMMOND?

00:17:06.059 --> 00:17:07.927
I'M VALERIE NELSON.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.996
OH. I'D LIKE TO HAVE A WORD
WITH YOU.

00:17:10.029 --> 00:17:11.298
WHAT'S THIS ALL ABOUT?

00:17:11.331 --> 00:17:13.200
WELL, IT SEEMS
THAT PAMELA WEILMAN

00:17:13.233 --> 00:17:15.568
HAD ANOTHER MOTIVE
FOR KILLING HER HUSBAND.

00:17:15.602 --> 00:17:17.003
ACCORDING TO
HIS PHONE RECORDS,

00:17:17.036 --> 00:17:19.539
HE WAS MAKING A LOT
OF LATE-NIGHT CALLS

00:17:19.572 --> 00:17:21.007
TO A PRETTY,
YOUNG COWORKER.

00:17:24.844 --> 00:17:26.546
Valerie:
I KNEW IT WAS WRONG, BUT...

00:17:26.579 --> 00:17:29.316
I FELL IN LOVE WITH HIM.

00:17:29.349 --> 00:17:33.086
Hammond: SO, WHERE WERE YOU
ON THE NIGHT OF MARCH 5th?

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:36.156
HOME...
WAITING FOR CLARK TO CALL.

00:17:36.189 --> 00:17:40.227
IT WAS THE NIGHT HE WAS GONNA
TELL PAMELA HE WAS LEAVING.

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:44.397
[ Voice breaking ] I GUESS
SHE DIDN'T TAKE IT SO WELL.

00:17:44.431 --> 00:17:48.335
ONE OF THE WIFE'S SYMPTOMS
IS ANTEROGRADE AMNESIA, RIGHT?

00:17:48.368 --> 00:17:50.803
SO HER HUSBAND COMES HOME,

00:17:50.837 --> 00:17:52.672
TELLS HER
THAT HE'S LEAVING HER

00:17:52.705 --> 00:17:54.574
FOR SOME HOTTIE
FROM THE OFFICE.

00:17:54.607 --> 00:17:56.909
SHE GOES INTO
AN ADRENALINE-FUELED RAGE,

00:17:56.943 --> 00:17:58.077
AND SHE KILLS HIM.

00:17:58.111 --> 00:17:59.912
BUT, BECAUSE
OF THE KORSAKOFF'S,

00:17:59.946 --> 00:18:01.881
BY THE TIME THE POLICE
GET THERE,

00:18:01.914 --> 00:18:04.184
SHE'S FORGOTTEN WHY
SHE KILLED THE GUY.

00:18:04.217 --> 00:18:05.118
AND WHEN THE DETECTIVE SAYS
SHE DID IT

00:18:05.152 --> 00:18:06.853
FOR THE INSURANCE MONEY --

00:18:06.886 --> 00:18:08.955
THAT'S HOW
IMPRESSIVE THEORY.

00:18:10.857 --> 00:18:12.359
BUT WRONG.

00:18:12.392 --> 00:18:15.362
PAMELA WEILMAN ISN'T A KILLER.
SHE'S A VICTIM.

00:18:15.395 --> 00:18:17.063
FIRST, HER HUSBAND
CHEATS ON HER,

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:19.532
AND THEN THIS NEANDERTHAL COP
TRIES TO PUT HER IN JAIL --

00:18:19.566 --> 00:18:21.901
WHICH IS TYPICAL OF HOW
THE MENTALLY ILL ARE TREATED

00:18:21.934 --> 00:18:23.470
BY OUR SO-CALLED
JUSTICE SYSTEM.

00:18:25.071 --> 00:18:27.374
WELL, I'M STUCK.

00:18:27.407 --> 00:18:29.742
AND THE ONLY THING
THAT I KNOW OF

00:18:29.776 --> 00:18:33.045
THAT'S GOING TO GET ME UNSTUCK
IS BURGER GREASE.

00:18:33.079 --> 00:18:34.847
YOU KNOW CHOLESTEROL
IS THE SILENT KILLER?

00:18:34.881 --> 00:18:36.616
YOU'LL HAVE A GARDEN BURGER.
I'LL BUY IT FOR YOU.

00:18:37.817 --> 00:18:40.220
LETNO.GO.

00:18:40.253 --> 00:18:42.021
[ CHUCKLES ]
NO, I-I CAN'T.

00:18:42.054 --> 00:18:44.557
I HAVE -- I HAVE AN APPOINTMENT.
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:18:47.194 --> 00:18:48.395
SO, WHY DIDN'T YOU SAY YES?

00:18:48.428 --> 00:18:50.397
BECAUSE I HAD A DATE
WITH YOU.

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:53.266
DANIEL, WE HAVEN'T HAD A DATE
SINCE GRAD SCHOOL.

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:54.767
IT'S TIME TO MOVE ON.

00:18:54.801 --> 00:18:57.103
ADMIT IT.
I'M WEARING YOU DOWN.

00:18:57.136 --> 00:18:58.438
[ Chuckling ]
I'M WEARING YOU DOWN.

00:18:58.471 --> 00:18:59.772
HOW DO YOU FEEL?

00:18:59.806 --> 00:19:02.442
I'M FINE. WHY?

00:19:02.475 --> 00:19:04.877
THIS CONSULTING WORK
CAN DISRUPT YOUR ROUTINE,

00:19:04.911 --> 00:19:06.446
AND WE BOTH KNOW
HOW YOU GET

00:19:06.479 --> 00:19:08.448
WHEN YOU DON'T STICK
TO YOUR ROUTINE.

00:19:08.481 --> 00:19:11.384
WHICH IS WHY I HAVE LEWICKI.
HE KEEPS ME ORGANIZED.

00:19:11.418 --> 00:19:14.387
WHAT ARE YOU GONNA DO
WHEN HE GRADUATES?

00:19:14.421 --> 00:19:16.189
[ SCOFFS ]
YOU KNOW --

00:19:16.223 --> 00:19:18.891
YOU KNOW HOW OFTEN LEWICKI
CHANGES MAJORS?

00:19:18.925 --> 00:19:21.594
I DON'T THINK THERE'S
MUCH DANGER OF GRADUATION.

00:19:21.628 --> 00:19:23.763
Announcer: FLY BALL TO RIGHT.
WELL-HIT.

00:19:23.796 --> 00:19:26.833
BACK NEAR THE WALL...
AND...GONE!

00:19:26.866 --> 00:19:28.167
INTO THE BASKET!

00:19:28.201 --> 00:19:30.002
YOU SEE THAT?

00:19:30.036 --> 00:19:31.204
IT'S SPRING TRAINING.

00:19:31.238 --> 00:19:32.805
LET'S SEE HOW THEY DO
IN OCTOBER.

00:19:32.839 --> 00:19:34.140
OH, YE OF LITTLE FAITH,

00:19:34.173 --> 00:19:35.775
I AM TELLING YOU,
THIS IS THE YEAR.

00:19:35.808 --> 00:19:38.077
BELIEVING THE CUBS
ARE GONNA WIN THE PENNANT --

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.412
THAT IS A SYMPTOM
OF A DELUSIONAL MIND.

00:19:39.446 --> 00:19:40.613
RATIONALITY'S OVERRATED,

00:19:40.647 --> 00:19:42.482
PARTICULARLY
IF YOU'RE A CUBS FAN.

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.452
I HAVE TO GO.

00:19:45.485 --> 00:19:48.621
I HAVE A CLASS TOMORROW.
AND SO DO YOU.

00:19:48.655 --> 00:19:50.290
THERE'S A GAME.
WHAT ABOUT THE GAME?

00:19:50.323 --> 00:19:52.792
WELL, I THINK WE BOTH KNOW
HOW THAT GONNA TURN OUT.

00:19:52.825 --> 00:19:54.361
BUT YOU ENJOY IT ANYWAY.

00:19:59.966 --> 00:20:01.301
[ CROWD CHEERS ]

00:20:01.334 --> 00:20:03.803
Natalie:
GOOD NIGHT, DANIEL.

00:20:03.836 --> 00:20:04.804
[ DOOR CLOSES ]

00:20:04.837 --> 00:20:06.639
...BAD THROW BY BAKER.

00:20:06.673 --> 00:20:08.641
EVERYBODY'S SAFE.

00:20:08.675 --> 00:20:10.477
SLOPPY GAME AGAIN DEFENSIVELY,

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:12.479
AND THAT ULTIMATELY
COST THE CUBS.

00:20:12.512 --> 00:20:15.147
SADISTS.

00:20:15.181 --> 00:20:17.650
[ DOORBELL RINGS ]

00:20:20.687 --> 00:20:23.756
LEWICKI?!

00:20:31.097 --> 00:20:33.666
DR. PIERCE...

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.768
I'M SO SORRY
TO BOTHER YOU AT HOME.

00:20:35.802 --> 00:20:38.070
YOU WORK AT TechSan.

00:20:38.104 --> 00:20:41.741
I-I COULDN'T -- I COULDN'T TALK
TO YOU IN FRONT OF EVERYONE.

00:20:41.774 --> 00:20:42.975
MY NAME'S GERARD PERMUT.

00:20:43.009 --> 00:20:44.911
WHAT CAN I DO FOR YOU,
MR. PERMUT?

00:20:44.944 --> 00:20:47.514
I-I HAVE INFORMATION
ON CLARK WEILMAN'S MURDER.

00:20:47.547 --> 00:20:49.482
YOU SHOULD
GO TO THE FBI.

00:20:49.516 --> 00:20:52.585
NO, I-I CAN'T, I CAN'T. I CAN'T
TRUST THEM, OKAY? I CAN'T.

00:20:52.619 --> 00:20:54.554
LISTEN, I-I'VE READ
ALL YOUR BOOKS,

00:20:54.587 --> 00:20:56.856
EVERY SINGLE ONE OF THEM,
AND I-I KNOW --

00:20:56.889 --> 00:20:59.158
I KNOW THAT YOU UNDERSTAND
PEOPLE LIKE ME.

00:20:59.191 --> 00:21:01.361
AND, PLEASE, I DON'T --

00:21:01.394 --> 00:21:02.862
I DON'T HAVE ANYONE ELSE
TO TURN TO. I REALLY --

00:21:02.895 --> 00:21:05.398
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.
ALL RIGHT.

00:21:08.067 --> 00:21:10.202
COME ON.
WOULD YOU LIKE TO SIT DOWN?

00:21:10.236 --> 00:21:11.538
I-I DIDN'T
MEAN TO DO IT,

00:21:11.571 --> 00:21:12.772
BUT THE VOICES
IN MY HEAD --

00:21:12.805 --> 00:21:14.707
THEY TOLD ME
THAT I HAD TO DO IT.

00:21:14.741 --> 00:21:17.444
ALL RIGHT. W-WHAT DID THE VOICES
TELL YOU TO DO?

00:21:17.477 --> 00:21:20.079
I'M IN LOVE
WITH VALERIE NELSON.

00:21:20.112 --> 00:21:24.116
I FOUND OUT THAT SHE WAS
SLEEPING WITH CLARK WEILMAN.

00:21:25.852 --> 00:21:28.921
THE VOICES TOLD ME
THAT THE PAIN WOULD --

00:21:28.955 --> 00:21:31.391
WOULD GO AWAY
IF I KILLED HIM.

00:21:31.424 --> 00:21:34.060
OHH!

00:21:34.093 --> 00:21:36.062
ALL RIGHT.
I-I'M GONNA GET YOU SOME HELP.

00:21:36.095 --> 00:21:38.565
SHE TOLD ME THAT
WE HAD A LIFE TOGETHER.

00:21:38.598 --> 00:21:40.633
THAT'S WHAT SHE SAID. I NEVER
SHOULD HAVE TRUSTED HER, EVER.

00:21:40.667 --> 00:21:41.768
THAT [BLEEP]
SHE'S A LIAR!

00:21:41.801 --> 00:21:43.035
LEWICKI!

00:21:43.069 --> 00:21:44.404
IT'S ALL RIGHT.LING?

00:21:44.437 --> 00:21:46.038
HE WORKS FOR ME,
ALL RIGHT?

00:21:46.072 --> 00:21:48.207
W-WE'RE GONNA GET YOU SOME HELP.
LEWICKI!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.042
[ CLATTERING ]

00:21:50.076 --> 00:21:51.778
YOU NEED SOMETHING, DOC?

00:21:51.811 --> 00:21:53.913
I'M RIGHT IN THE MIDDLE OF
KICKING OBI-WAN'S JEDI [BLEEP]

00:21:53.946 --> 00:21:55.748
I'M SORRY TO CALL YOU AWAY
FROM SOMETHING SO URGENT.

00:21:55.782 --> 00:21:58.385
BUT AS YOU CAN SEE,
I HAVE A SITUATION HERE.

00:22:08.294 --> 00:22:10.096
THERE'S NO ONE ELSE HERE,
IS THERE?

00:22:10.129 --> 00:22:12.765
NO, DOC.

00:22:12.799 --> 00:22:14.701
IT'S JUST YOU AND ME.

00:22:20.807 --> 00:22:23.109
ALMOST HAD YOU.

00:22:31.017 --> 00:22:33.686
[ CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYS ]

00:22:46.866 --> 00:22:49.802
DOC.

00:22:53.139 --> 00:22:54.907
DOC, YOU HAVE TO EAT.

00:22:54.941 --> 00:22:56.776
[ MUSIC STOPS ]

00:22:56.809 --> 00:22:58.277
THIS IS NOT WHAT I WANTED.

00:22:58.310 --> 00:22:59.712
IT'S MAHLER'S FIRST.

00:22:59.746 --> 00:23:01.614
THAT IS THE VON KARAJAN
RECORDING.

00:23:01.648 --> 00:23:02.882
I ASKED FOR THE SOLTI.

00:23:05.351 --> 00:23:08.688
DO YOU KNOW HOW HARD IT IS
TO FIND A CASSETTE TAPE?

00:23:08.721 --> 00:23:10.423
ALL RIGHT, IF YOU JUST LET ME
BUY YOU AN iPod,

00:23:10.457 --> 00:23:12.692
WE CAN DOWNLOAD ANY RECORDING
YOU WANT.

00:23:12.725 --> 00:23:15.027
YOU KNOW WHAT? THAT'S
NOT A BAD IDEA. YOU GOT
TO GET WITH THE PROGRAM.

00:23:15.061 --> 00:23:16.162
JUST STAY OUT OF THIS.

00:23:19.398 --> 00:23:21.534
HE'S HERE?

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:26.005
YOU KNOW, DOC,

00:23:26.038 --> 00:23:28.941
MAYBE THIS GUY
ISN'T JUST A HALLUCINATION.

00:23:28.975 --> 00:23:32.311
YOU KNOW, MAYBE HE'S SOME KIND
OF PSYCHIC VISION.

00:23:32.344 --> 00:23:34.213
THERE HAVE BEEN STUDIES
THAT SHOW THAT THESE --

00:23:34.246 --> 00:23:36.415
NO, LEWICKI,
THERE HAVE BEEN NO STUDIES.

00:23:36.449 --> 00:23:39.251
THERE HAVE BEEN FRAUDS AND SCAMS
AND ENTERTAINMENTS --

00:23:39.285 --> 00:23:40.453
OKAY, YOU SAID
THIS VISION TOLD YOU

00:23:40.487 --> 00:23:41.654
HE WAS JEALOUS
OF THE DEAD GUY.

00:23:41.688 --> 00:23:43.923
MAYBE THERE REALLY IS
SOME KIND

00:23:43.956 --> 00:23:47.594
OF TWISTED LOVE-TRIANGLE THING
[ TELEPHONE RINGS ]

00:23:47.627 --> 00:23:48.895
WHY DO YOU KEEP
THIS IDIOT AROUND?

00:23:48.928 --> 00:23:50.396
BECAUSE WHEN [BLEEP]
LIKE YOU SHOW UP,

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:52.431
I NEED SOMEONE TO TELL ME
THAT YOU'RE NOT REAL.

00:23:52.465 --> 00:23:54.601
WHAT'S HE SAYING?

00:23:54.634 --> 00:23:56.469
DOES -- DOES HE AGREE
WITH WHAT I WAS SAYING?

00:23:56.503 --> 00:23:58.237
[ RINANSWER THAT!ES ]

00:24:00.973 --> 00:24:02.809
DR. PIERCE'S RESIDENCE.

00:24:05.712 --> 00:24:07.680
YES, I'LL TELL HIM.

00:24:07.714 --> 00:24:08.848
[ RECEIVER HANGS UP ]

00:24:08.881 --> 00:24:11.217
DEAN HALEY
WANTS TO SEE YOU.

00:24:13.285 --> 00:24:15.254
WHAT IN GOD'S NAME
WERE YOU THINKING, DANIEL?

00:24:15.287 --> 00:24:16.789
I'LL TELL YOU EXACTLY
WHAT I WAS THINKING, PAUL.

00:24:16.823 --> 00:24:18.758
I WAS THINKING THIS
PHEROMONE-SPEWING 20-YEAR-OLD

00:24:18.791 --> 00:24:20.426
HAS BEEN SITTING IN
THE FRONT ROW OF MY CLASS

00:24:20.459 --> 00:24:22.261
MAKING EYES AT ME
FOR THREE SEMESTERS RUNNING,

00:24:22.294 --> 00:24:24.430
AND NOW SHE'S INVITING ME
FOR A LATTE.

00:24:24.463 --> 00:24:25.932
OH, AND, BY THE WAY,

00:24:25.965 --> 00:24:27.967
SHE'S STICKING A SKIN-TIGHT
T-SHIRT IN MY FACE,

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:29.969
ADVERTISING HERSELF
AS A "STIMULUS PACKAGE."

00:24:30.002 --> 00:24:33.205
I DON'T NEED
ANY MORE STIMULI.

00:24:33.239 --> 00:24:35.875
Look, you can't just go around
accusing students

00:24:35.908 --> 00:24:37.710
of wanting to have sex
with you,

00:24:37.744 --> 00:24:39.311
especially not in front
of witnesses.

00:24:39.345 --> 00:24:40.747
WHAT WITNESSES?

00:24:40.780 --> 00:24:42.448
[ SCOFFS ]
ARE YOU REALLY THAT OBLIVIOUS?

00:24:42.481 --> 00:24:43.816
SHE WAS WITH A FRIEND.

00:24:43.850 --> 00:24:45.518
THAT'S WHO FILED
THE COMPLAINT.

00:24:45.552 --> 00:24:47.286
YOU'RE JOKING.
TELL ME YOU'RE...

00:24:47.319 --> 00:24:49.121
LOOK, DANIEL, I HAVE PUT UP
WITH ALL OF YOUR ECCENTRICITIES

00:24:49.155 --> 00:24:51.390
BECAUSE YOU ARE
A BRILLIANT SCHOLAR,

00:24:51.423 --> 00:24:53.893
YOU'RE A POPULAR TEACHER,
AND YOU'RE MY FRIEND.

00:24:53.926 --> 00:24:55.795
BUT HAVE YOU ANY IDEA

00:24:55.828 --> 00:24:59.231
WHAT KIND OF A HIT OUR ENDOWMENT
HAS TAKEN, HMM?

00:24:59.265 --> 00:25:01.267
WE CANNOT AFFORD
A LAWSUIT.

00:25:01.300 --> 00:25:03.736
WHAT ARE YOU
ASKING ME TO DO?

00:25:03.770 --> 00:25:06.539
HE WANTS ME TO APOLOGIZE --
TO BOTH GIRLS.

00:25:06.573 --> 00:25:08.641
[ CHUCKLES ]
IT'S OUTRAGEOUS!

00:25:08.675 --> 00:25:11.544
WHY ARE YOU SMILING?
WHAT, Y-YOU THINK THIS IS FUNNY?

00:25:11.578 --> 00:25:12.945
WHAT I THINK IS, IS THAT
YOU DEFLECTED THIS OFFER

00:25:12.979 --> 00:25:14.513
FROM THIS STUDENT
FOR THE SAME REASON

00:25:14.547 --> 00:25:16.683
YOU TURNED DOWN THE DINNER
INVITATION WITH KATE MORETTI.

00:25:16.716 --> 00:25:18.517
ENLIGHTEN ME.

00:25:18.551 --> 00:25:20.653
YOU ARE PETRIFIED OF
ANYTHING REMOTELY RESEMBLING

00:25:20.687 --> 00:25:22.822
AN INTIMATE CONNECTION
WITH ANOTHER HUMAN BEING.

00:25:22.855 --> 00:25:25.057
OH, SPARE ME
THE PSYCHOBABBLE.

00:25:25.091 --> 00:25:27.359
TELL ME I'M WRONG.

00:25:27.393 --> 00:25:29.361
NATALIE, LOOK AT ME.

00:25:29.395 --> 00:25:31.698
I-I-I HEAR VOICES.

00:25:31.731 --> 00:25:35.034
I SEE THINGS THAT AREN'T THERE.
I TALK TO THE WALLS.

00:25:37.970 --> 00:25:40.272
HOW AM I EVER GONNA HAVE

00:25:40.306 --> 00:25:43.976
AN INTIMATE CONNECTION
WITH ANYBODY?

00:25:45.511 --> 00:25:46.846
YOU HAD AN INCIDENT.

00:25:48.347 --> 00:25:50.049
DANIEL?

00:25:56.222 --> 00:25:57.590
WELL,
SOMETIMES THIS HAPPENS.

00:25:57.624 --> 00:25:59.091
YOU DEAL WITH IT,
AND YOU MOVE ON.

00:25:59.125 --> 00:26:02.028
[ SCOFFS ]
RIGHT.

00:26:02.061 --> 00:26:04.697
SO, WHY IS IT
THAT I GET THE FEELING

00:26:04.731 --> 00:26:06.699
THAT YOU'RE MORE WORRIED
ABOUT THIS THAN USUAL?

00:26:09.435 --> 00:26:13.439
WHAT IF NEXT TIME
IT HAPPENS IN FRONT OF KATE?

00:26:14.641 --> 00:26:17.910
YOU TOLD KATE ABOUT
YOUR CONDITION A LONG TIME AGO.

00:26:17.944 --> 00:26:23.015
WELL, KNOWING AND SEEING
ARE TWO DIFFERENT THINGS.

00:26:25.251 --> 00:26:28.921
I DON'T -- M-MAYBE
I SHOULD GET OFF THIS CASE.

00:26:28.955 --> 00:26:32.158
QUIT WITHOUT SOLVING IT?
THEN YOU'D REALLY GO CRAZY.

00:26:33.926 --> 00:26:37.063
HAVE YOU TALKED TO ROSENTHAL
ABOUT GOING BACK ON YOUR MEDS?

00:26:37.096 --> 00:26:38.865
NO, NO.

00:26:38.898 --> 00:26:41.901
WE'VE TALKED -- LOOK, FOR SOME
PEOPLE, THEY'RE A MIRACLE --

00:26:41.934 --> 00:26:43.135
N-NOT ME.

00:26:43.169 --> 00:26:45.337
BUT YOU HAD
FEWER SYMPTOMS.

00:26:45.371 --> 00:26:47.707
AND I COULDN'T CONCENTRATE
LONG ENOUGH

00:26:47.740 --> 00:26:49.208
TO FINISH A [BLEEP] SODOKU.

00:26:49.241 --> 00:26:51.410
I COULDN'T WRITE.
I COULDN'T WORK.

00:26:51.443 --> 00:26:54.580
NO, NO, NO.
I-I CAN HANDLE THIS, NAT.

00:26:54.613 --> 00:26:58.751
I JUST -- I'LL KEEP UP
MY TALK THERAPY WITH ROSENTHAL.

00:26:58.785 --> 00:27:02.521
I-I'LL STICK TO MY ROUTINE.
I'LL WATCH MY DIET.

00:27:02.554 --> 00:27:05.725
I'LL KEEP MY MIND FOCUSED
AND OCCUPIED.

00:27:05.758 --> 00:27:08.094
OKAY. WELL,
LET'S FOCUS ON THE INCIDENT.

00:27:08.127 --> 00:27:09.161
TELL ME ABOUT IT.

00:27:09.195 --> 00:27:10.529
WHAT IS THERE TO TELL?

00:27:10.562 --> 00:27:12.631
IT WAS A SCHIZOPHRENIC
HALLUCINATION.

00:27:12.665 --> 00:27:15.267
IT WAS THE PRODUCT
OF RANDOMLY FIRING NEURONS.

00:27:15.301 --> 00:27:17.469
DANIEL, YOU KNOW
HOW YOUR MIND WORKS.

00:27:17.503 --> 00:27:19.538
SOMETIMES THESE HALLUCINATIONS
TELL YOU THINGS

00:27:19.571 --> 00:27:21.573
THAT YOUR CONSCIOUS MIND
CAN'T MAKE SENSE OF.

00:27:24.110 --> 00:27:26.612
TELL ME WHAT YOU SAW.

00:27:31.984 --> 00:27:34.120
THE MAN.

00:27:34.153 --> 00:27:36.622
HE WORKS AT TechSan,
THEN HE CAME TO MY HOUSE,

00:27:36.655 --> 00:27:38.190
SAID HE WAS THE KILLER,

00:27:38.224 --> 00:27:40.392
WHICH I'M PRETTY SURE
IS PHYSICALLY IMPOSSIBLE.

00:27:40.426 --> 00:27:42.094
WHAT ELSE DID HE SAY?

00:27:46.866 --> 00:27:51.670
THAT VALERIE NELSON
IS A LIAR.

00:27:51.704 --> 00:27:52.805
WHO IS SHE?

00:27:54.741 --> 00:27:56.976
SHE WAS HAVING AN AFFAIR
WITH THE VICTIM.

00:27:58.344 --> 00:28:01.814
SHE SAYS SHE HAS NOTHING TO DO
WITH THE CRIME.

00:28:01.848 --> 00:28:05.317
AND THE POLICE
BELIEVE HER.

00:28:05.351 --> 00:28:08.654
WELL, IF SHE'S LYING...

00:28:08.687 --> 00:28:10.622
HOW COULD YOU PROVE IT?

00:28:10.656 --> 00:28:14.994
THE INTERNATIONAL ATOMIC ENERGY
AGENCY CONFIRMED IN THE 1990s

00:28:15.027 --> 00:28:16.729
THAT SADDAM HUSSEIN

00:28:16.763 --> 00:28:19.331
HAD AN ADVANCED NUCLEAR WEAPONS
DEVELOPMENT PROGRAM.

00:28:19.365 --> 00:28:21.333
WHY ARE YOU MAKING ME RELIVE
THIS NIGHTMARE?

00:28:21.367 --> 00:28:22.735
JUST WATCH.

00:28:22.769 --> 00:28:24.303
...HAD A DESIGN
FOR A NUCLEAR WEAPON

00:28:24.336 --> 00:28:26.105
AND WAS WORKING
ON FIVE DIFFERENT METHODS

00:28:26.138 --> 00:28:28.107
OF ENRICHING URANIUM
FOR A BOMB.

00:28:28.140 --> 00:28:30.042
THE BRITISH GOVERNMENT
HAS LEARNED

00:28:30.076 --> 00:28:32.544
THAT SADDAM HUSSEIN RECENTLY
SOUGHT SIGNIFICANT QUANTITIES

00:28:32.578 --> 00:28:33.679
OF URANIUM FROM AFRICA.

00:28:33.712 --> 00:28:36.015
[ LAUGHING ]

00:28:37.583 --> 00:28:40.719
INTELLIGENCE SOURCES TELL US
THAT HE HAS ATTEMPTED TO...

00:28:40.753 --> 00:28:44.190
THANK YOU, JIMMY.

00:28:44.223 --> 00:28:45.892
JIMMY'S AN APHASIAC.

00:28:45.925 --> 00:28:48.761
HE'S LOST THE ABILITY TO
COMPREHEND SPOKEN LANGUAGE.

00:28:48.795 --> 00:28:51.630
TO COMPENSATE, MANY APHASIACS
BECOME HIGHLY SENSITIVE

00:28:51.663 --> 00:28:53.565
TO SUBTLE INFLECTIONS
IN SPEECH.

00:28:53.599 --> 00:28:55.001
NOW, WHEN WE LIE,

00:28:55.034 --> 00:28:57.136
THOSE VOCAL NUANCES
BECOME MORE PRONOUNCED.

00:28:57.169 --> 00:28:59.671
MOST OF US WOULDN'T NOTICE,
BUT APHASIACS DO.

00:28:59.705 --> 00:29:02.274
AND FOR SOME REASON,
TO THEM, IT SOUNDS FUNNY.

00:29:02.308 --> 00:29:05.211
HE'S A HUMAN LIE DETECTOR.

00:29:05.244 --> 00:29:06.412
NOW, P-PUT THAT IN.

00:29:09.181 --> 00:29:10.516
YOU'RE DOING GREAT.

00:29:16.055 --> 00:29:18.357
Hammond: SO, WHERE WERE YOU
ON THE NIGHT OF MARCH 5th?

00:29:18.390 --> 00:29:22.761
HOME...
WAITING FOR CLARK TO CALL.

00:29:22.795 --> 00:29:24.563
[ LAUGHING ]

00:29:24.596 --> 00:29:28.300
IT WAS THE NIGHT HE WAS GONNA
TELL PAMELA HE WAS LEAVING.

00:29:39.812 --> 00:29:43.315
MS. NELSON,
AGENT MORETTI, FBI.

00:29:51.858 --> 00:29:53.893
M[ GROANS ]!

00:29:53.926 --> 00:29:56.262
VALERIE? VALERIE?

00:30:00.933 --> 00:30:02.734
I NEED AN AMBULANCE.

00:30:07.739 --> 00:30:09.475
[ INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS ]

00:30:12.178 --> 00:30:14.480
[ POLICE RADIO CHATTER ]

00:30:14.513 --> 00:30:16.482
PROBERT!

00:30:16.515 --> 00:30:18.417
THINK SHE'S
GONNA MAKE IT?

00:30:18.450 --> 00:30:19.785
IT'S TOO EARLY TO SAY.

00:30:19.818 --> 00:30:22.088
VICIOUS BLOW TO THE BACK
OF THE HEAD LIKE THAT?

00:30:22.121 --> 00:30:24.756
SHE MIGHT NOT EVEN
HAVE SEEN HER ATTACKER.

00:30:24.790 --> 00:30:26.825
WHY ARE WE STILL
ON THIS CASE?

00:30:26.859 --> 00:30:29.228
CHICAGO P.D.
SHOULD BE HANDLING IT.

00:30:29.261 --> 00:30:32.164
JUST FIND OUT
WHO SHE'S BEEN TALKING TO.

00:30:33.765 --> 00:30:36.235
WHAT'S THE NATURE OF YOUR
RELATIONSHIP WITH MS. NELSON?

00:30:36.268 --> 00:30:37.870
I COULDN'T HAVE PICKED HER OUT
OF THE CROWD

00:30:37.904 --> 00:30:39.105
AT THE COMPANY PICNIC.

00:30:39.138 --> 00:30:40.472
THEN WHY THE CALLS?

00:30:40.506 --> 00:30:41.941
WE CAME DOWN HERE
VOLUNTARILY.

00:30:41.974 --> 00:30:43.442
MR. KLANE ISN'T
UNDER ANY OBLIGATION

00:30:43.475 --> 00:30:44.843
TO ANSWER THESE QUESTIONS.

00:30:44.877 --> 00:30:46.345
WERE YOU AWARE THAT VALERIE
WAS HAVING AN AFFAIR

00:30:46.378 --> 00:30:47.679
WITH YOUR DEAD
GENERAL COUNSEL?

00:30:47.713 --> 00:30:49.815
WHAT DOES THAT HAVE TO DO
WITH ME?

00:30:49.848 --> 00:30:52.151
MAYBE CLARK WEILMAN
WASN'T THE ONLY ONE

00:30:52.184 --> 00:30:55.354
GETTING EXECUTIVE PERKS
FROM VALERIE.

00:30:55.387 --> 00:30:58.857
MAYBE YOU FOUND OUT,
GOT JEALOUS, KILLED CLARK,

00:30:58.891 --> 00:31:00.459
AND THEN YOU TRIED TO DO
THE SAME THING TO VALERIE.

00:31:00.492 --> 00:31:02.128
WHAT?!
WE'RE DONE HERE.

00:31:02.161 --> 00:31:04.863
THAT'S OKAY. WE'VE GOT
HER HARD DRIVES, E-MAILS.

00:31:04.897 --> 00:31:06.532
EVEN IF SHE DOESN'T
SURVIVE THIS SURGERY,

00:31:06.565 --> 00:31:08.634
WE WILL FIND OUT
WHAT THE TWO OF YOU WERE UP TO.

00:31:08.667 --> 00:31:11.170
OKAY, PHILIP,
SIT, SIT, IT'S FINE.

00:31:11.203 --> 00:31:14.806
CHAMOMILE.
NO MILK, NO SUGAR.

00:31:14.840 --> 00:31:16.208
AFTER CLARK WAS KILLED,

00:31:16.242 --> 00:31:17.977
I GOT AN E-MAIL
FROM MS. VALERIE

00:31:18.010 --> 00:31:20.179
SAYING IT WAS URGENT
I SHOULD CALL HER, SO I DID.

00:31:20.212 --> 00:31:21.347
YOU'RE WELCOME.

00:31:21.380 --> 00:31:22.714
SHE SAID SHE HAD INFORMATION

00:31:22.748 --> 00:31:23.649
THAT COULD BE DAMAGING
TO THE COMPANY.

00:31:23.682 --> 00:31:25.717
WHAT KIND OF INFORMATION?

00:31:25.751 --> 00:31:28.320
SOMETHING ABOUT ANOMALOUS
STUDY RESULTS FOR ONE
OF OUR PRODUCTS.

00:31:28.354 --> 00:31:29.688
SHE SAID SHE DIDN'T WANT TO
TA Gerard: DON'T DRINK THAT. E.

00:31:29.721 --> 00:31:31.623
WHAT TIME?

00:31:31.657 --> 00:31:33.960
IT MIGHT KILL YOU.

00:31:35.727 --> 00:31:37.563
[ GASPS ]

00:31:37.596 --> 00:31:39.665
ARE YOU TRYING
TO POISON ME?!

00:31:39.698 --> 00:31:41.800
I TOLD YOU,
NO MILK, NO SUGAR.

00:31:41.833 --> 00:31:44.736
COME ON, DOC.
THAT'S THE TEA?ER WEAPON.

00:31:44.770 --> 00:31:45.771
YEAH, IT'S TEA.

00:31:47.473 --> 00:31:49.541
NOT TEA -- POISON.
REMEMBER TIMOTHY MAY?

00:31:49.575 --> 00:31:51.210
SAID HIS MOTHER
WAS POISONED.

00:31:51.243 --> 00:31:53.445
I POISONED HER...
AND KILLED CLARK WEILMAN.

00:31:53.479 --> 00:31:55.447
WHAT'S TO UNDERSTAND?

00:31:55.481 --> 00:31:57.016
SHE'S TRYING TO
ESTABLISH MOTIVE.

00:31:57.049 --> 00:31:58.684
I'LL GIVE YOU A MOTIVE.

00:31:58.717 --> 00:32:00.252
SHE WAS GOING TO EXPOSE ME,
AND NOW THAT'S YOUR JOB.

00:32:00.286 --> 00:32:01.853
HOW?

00:32:01.887 --> 00:32:03.990
CAN YOU BE QUIET, PLEASE?
I'M TRYING TO LISTEN.

00:32:07.226 --> 00:32:10.429
AAH!
WHAT THE [BLEEP]

00:32:10.462 --> 00:32:12.098
I JUST BOUGHT THIS SUIT!

00:32:12.131 --> 00:32:13.632
SORRY. TRY CLUB SODA.

00:32:18.304 --> 00:32:21.573
YOU'VE HAD A GUT FEELING
ALL THIS TIME, HAVEN'T YOU,

00:32:21.607 --> 00:32:23.409
ESPECIALLY AFTER WHAT
TIMOTHY MAY SAID ABOUT HIS MOM

00:32:23.442 --> 00:32:24.876
AND WHAT THOSE PEOPLE
AT TechSan CLAIMED

00:32:24.910 --> 00:32:25.911
ABOUT THE INSULPRIN STUDY.

00:32:25.944 --> 00:32:27.879
WHAT ARE YOU
TALKING ABOUT?

00:32:27.913 --> 00:32:29.115
DON'T YOU REMEMBER
MY NAME?

00:32:29.148 --> 00:32:31.117
GERARD PERMUT.
SO WHAT?

00:32:31.150 --> 00:32:32.918
SO, I KNOW HOW MUCH
YOU LIKE PUZZLES.

00:32:32.951 --> 00:32:35.988
IT'S ANOTHER ANAGRAM.

00:33:10.156 --> 00:33:12.958
I SOLVED IT.

00:33:12.991 --> 00:33:15.194
I THINK I SOLVED IT.

00:33:16.528 --> 00:33:21.300
Kate: "GERARD PERMUT.
DRUG TAMPERER."

00:33:21.333 --> 00:33:22.634
WHO'S GERARD PERMUT?

00:33:22.668 --> 00:33:24.036
YOU WROTE ON THE WALL?

00:33:24.070 --> 00:33:25.471
I THINK
SOMEBODY TAMPERED

00:33:25.504 --> 00:33:26.638
WITH THE RESULTS
OF THE INSULPRIN STUDY.

00:33:26.672 --> 00:33:27.806
WHAT MAKES YOU SAY THAT?

00:33:27.839 --> 00:33:29.308
GUT FEELING.

00:33:29.341 --> 00:33:31.810
TIMOTHY MAY BELIEVED HIS MOTHER
WAS POISONED,

00:33:31.843 --> 00:33:33.479
THAT HER HEART ATTACK WAS CAUSED
BY THE MEDICATION.

00:33:33.512 --> 00:33:34.680
TIMOTHY MAY IS PARANOID.

00:33:34.713 --> 00:33:36.115
THAT DOESN'T
MAKE HIM WRONG.

00:33:36.148 --> 00:33:37.549
MAY'S MOTHER
WAS TAKING A PLACEBO.

00:33:37.583 --> 00:33:39.318
ACCORDING TO THE DATA
REPORTED BY THE COMPANY.

00:33:39.351 --> 00:33:40.786
WHICH YOU BELIEVE
WAS TAMPERED WITH.

00:33:40.819 --> 00:33:43.189
IT WOULD COST
THE COMPANY BILLIONS

00:33:43.222 --> 00:33:45.357
TO PULL THAT DRUG
OFF THE MARKET.

00:33:45.391 --> 00:33:48.327
C.E.O. WOULD CERTAINLY HAVE
MOTIVE TO COVER THAT UP.

00:33:48.360 --> 00:33:49.928
MAYBE.

00:33:49.961 --> 00:33:53.799
BUT WHO HAD DIRECT ACCESS
TO THE STUDY RESULTS?

00:33:58.870 --> 00:34:00.672
Kate: DR. BRYANT.

00:34:00.706 --> 00:34:02.841
AGENT MORETTI.
DR. PIERCE.

00:34:02.874 --> 00:34:05.844
WHAT CAN I DO FOR YOU?

00:34:05.877 --> 00:34:07.146
WE ARE TRYING TO FIGURE OUT

00:34:07.179 --> 00:34:08.514
WHO TRIED TO KILL
VALERIE NELSON.

00:34:08.547 --> 00:34:11.350
WE FOUND THESE
ON HER HARD DRIVE.

00:34:11.383 --> 00:34:15.387
WE WERE HOPING MAYBE YOU COULD
TELL US WHAT THEY ARE.

00:34:15.421 --> 00:34:18.023
WELL, THESE LOOK LIKE
STUDY RESULTS

00:34:18.056 --> 00:34:19.458
OF MORBIDITY RATES.

00:34:19.491 --> 00:34:21.293
RIGHT,
FROM YOUR INSULPRIN TRIAL,

00:34:21.327 --> 00:34:24.029
EXCEPT THEY SHOW AN UNUSUALLY
HIGH INCIDENCE OF HEART ATTACK

00:34:24.062 --> 00:34:26.198
AMONG WOMEN PARTICIPATING
IN THE STUDY.

00:34:26.232 --> 00:34:28.734
YEAH, WELL, THERE --
THERE MUST BE A MISTAKE.

00:34:28.767 --> 00:34:30.402
WHAT ABOUT THIS ONE?

00:34:31.737 --> 00:34:33.539
AH, YES.
THESE ARE THE CORRECT RESULTS.

00:34:33.572 --> 00:34:35.307
AH. YOU SEE HERE?

00:34:35.341 --> 00:34:37.476
THE INCIDENCE OF HEART ATTACKS
IS APPROXIMATELY THE SAME

00:34:37.509 --> 00:34:38.677
FOR THOSE TAKING THE PLACEBO

00:34:38.710 --> 00:34:40.312
AS FOR THOSE
TAKING THE REAL DRUG.

00:34:40.346 --> 00:34:42.681
BUT ONLY BECAUSE SOMEBODY
TAMPERED WITH THESE RESULTS.

00:34:42.714 --> 00:34:45.384
THEY MOVED PATIENT NAMES
FROM ONE GROUP INTO THE OTHER.

00:34:45.417 --> 00:34:47.819
COME ON.
WHO'D DO SOMETHING LIKE THAT?

00:34:47.853 --> 00:34:50.556
DR. PIERCE TELLS ME

00:34:50.589 --> 00:34:53.024
THAT PHARMACOLOGISTS
OF YOUR STATURE

00:34:53.058 --> 00:34:54.726
GET PRETTY SWEET DEALS --

00:34:54.760 --> 00:34:57.396
SHARED PATENTS
ON THE DRUGS YOU DEVELOP.

00:34:57.429 --> 00:34:58.997
WHAT ARE YOU
TRYING TO SAY?

00:34:59.030 --> 00:35:01.200
VALERIE FOUND OUT YOU WERE
FALSIFYING THE STUDY,

00:35:01.233 --> 00:35:04.336
SO SHE WENT TO HER BOYFRIEND,
TechSan's TOP LAWYER.

00:35:04.370 --> 00:35:06.338
THEY WERE GONNA RUIN EVERYTHING
THAT YOU HAD WORKED FOR,

00:35:06.372 --> 00:35:07.506
SO YOU HAD TO STOP THEM.

00:35:07.539 --> 00:35:08.907
[ SCOFFS ]
THAT'S RIDICULOUS.

00:35:08.940 --> 00:35:09.908
SIZE 10 BROGANS?

00:35:09.941 --> 00:35:12.411
YOUR SHOES.

00:35:14.112 --> 00:35:17.149
YOU LEFT A BLOODY FOOTPRINT
IN VALERIE'S APARTMENT.

00:35:32.598 --> 00:35:34.666
YOU SPEND
YOUR WHOLE CAREER

00:35:34.700 --> 00:35:36.435
LOOKING FOR THAT
ONE MIRACLE CURE, YOU KNOW?

00:35:37.936 --> 00:35:40.406
THIS WASN'T ABOUT MONEY FOR YOU.
IT WAS ABOUT SCIENCE.

00:35:40.439 --> 00:35:42.241
YOU UNDERSTAND,
DR. PIERCE.

00:35:42.274 --> 00:35:44.243
EVERY DRUG
HAS SIDE EFFECTS.

00:35:44.276 --> 00:35:46.778
I FIGURED OUT WHY IT WAS CAUSING
THE HEART ATTACKS.

00:35:46.812 --> 00:35:48.747
I COULD HAVE WORKED OUT
THE KINKS...

00:35:48.780 --> 00:35:51.383
BUT VALERIE STARTED
COLLECTING EVIDENCE AGAINST ME

00:35:51.417 --> 00:35:52.484
LIKE I'M A CRIMINAL.

00:35:52.518 --> 00:35:53.985
YOU MEAN
THE STUDY RESULTS.

00:35:54.019 --> 00:35:55.654
YES.

00:35:55.687 --> 00:35:57.689
AND THEN I SAW HER
STEALING PILLS...

00:36:02.994 --> 00:36:04.530
SO I FOLLOWED HER.

00:36:10.001 --> 00:36:12.638
SHE BROUGHT THEM TO CLARK.

00:36:14.873 --> 00:36:17.276
SHE GOES TO A LAWYER
INSTEAD OF ME?!

00:36:17.309 --> 00:36:18.677
YOU FIGURED
THAT THEY WERE GOING

00:36:18.710 --> 00:36:20.312
TO GET THE PILLS
INDEPENDENTLY TESTED,

00:36:20.346 --> 00:36:22.147
PROVE THAT
THEY WERE DANGEROUS.

00:36:22.180 --> 00:36:24.483
I THOUGHT...

00:36:24.516 --> 00:36:26.318
IF I COULD JUST
MAKE HIM UNDERSTAND.

00:36:26.352 --> 00:36:28.687
CLARK, I DON'T KNOW WHAT
VALERIE'S BEEN TELLING YOU,

00:36:28.720 --> 00:36:29.821
BUT I CAN FIX THIS.

00:36:29.855 --> 00:36:31.122
DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA
THE LIABILITY

00:36:31.156 --> 00:36:32.291
YOU'VE EXPOSED
THIS COMPANY TO?

00:36:32.324 --> 00:36:33.725
CLARK, PLEASE!

00:36:33.759 --> 00:36:35.861
GET OUT OF HERE
BEFORE I GET THE POLICE!

00:36:39.365 --> 00:36:41.367
OHH!

00:36:44.035 --> 00:36:46.272
[ GRUNTING ]

00:36:47.839 --> 00:36:50.842
I GUESS...

00:36:52.544 --> 00:36:54.880
I GUESS I WENT
A LITTLE CRAZY.

00:36:57.883 --> 00:37:00.519
[ POLICE RADIO CHATTER ]

00:37:00.552 --> 00:37:02.521
NICE WORK, DETECTIVE.

00:37:02.554 --> 00:37:03.855
Hammond: PSYCHO.

00:37:03.889 --> 00:37:05.023
YOU DIDN'T TELL ME
YOU FOUND A FOOTPRINT

00:37:05.056 --> 00:37:06.024
IN VALERIE'S APARTMENT.

00:37:06.057 --> 00:37:07.192
I DIDN'T.

00:37:07.225 --> 00:37:11.196
DETECTIVE MORETTI,
I AM SHOCKED

00:37:11.229 --> 00:37:13.031
THAT YOU WOULD
SO BLATANTLY MANIPULATE

00:37:13.064 --> 00:37:15.200
AN OBVIOUSLY TROUBLED
INDIVIDUAL.

00:37:17.068 --> 00:37:18.804
Gerard:
WHAT'S UP, DOC?

00:37:20.372 --> 00:37:23.342
DANIEL, WHAT IS IT?

00:37:23.375 --> 00:37:25.344
IT'S NOTHING.
[ CHUCKLES ]

00:37:25.377 --> 00:37:27.178
NO, IT'S NOT NOTHING.

00:37:27.212 --> 00:37:28.647
YOU CAUGHT THE KILLER.

00:37:28.680 --> 00:37:31.717
SO, WHAT THE [BLEEP]
AM I STILL DOING HERE?

00:37:34.420 --> 00:37:36.221
CASE ISN'T OVER YET.

00:37:36.254 --> 00:37:38.223
WHAT ARE YOU
TALKING ABOUT?

00:37:40.426 --> 00:37:42.728
DANIEL?

00:37:45.130 --> 00:37:46.932
DR. BRYANT!

00:37:46.965 --> 00:37:48.099
WHAT NOW?

00:37:48.133 --> 00:37:49.401
YOU SAID
YOU FIGURED OUT WHY

00:37:49.435 --> 00:37:51.169
INSULPRIN WAS
CAUSING HEART ATTACKS.

00:37:51.202 --> 00:37:53.171
WHAT WAS IT?

00:37:53.204 --> 00:37:57.008
THE DRUG WAS DEPLETING
PATIENTS' THIAMINE LEVELS.

00:37:57.042 --> 00:38:00.011
DANIEL,
WHAT IS GOING ON?

00:38:00.045 --> 00:38:02.113
THERE'S ANOTHER VICTIM.

00:38:07.085 --> 00:38:10.756
I RAN THE SECOND TOX SCREEN
YOU ASKED FOR.

00:38:10.789 --> 00:38:13.091
WE FOUND SIGNIFICANT LEVELS
OF CONCANAVALIN A.

00:38:13.124 --> 00:38:15.427
THE PRIMARY SUGAR-BINDING
MOLECULE IN INSULPRIN.

00:38:15.461 --> 00:38:17.095
"SHE'S JUST A EXCUSE ME?

00:38:17.128 --> 00:38:18.564
YOU WERE RIGHT, HARVEY.

00:38:18.597 --> 00:38:20.198
PAMELA WEILMAN ISN'T BULIMIC.
SHE'S JUST THIN.

00:38:20.231 --> 00:38:22.033
IT WAS INSULPRIN
THAT DEPLETED HER THIAMINE.

00:38:22.067 --> 00:38:23.268
IF MRS. WEILMAN
WASN'T DIABETIC,

00:38:23.301 --> 00:38:24.836
WHY WOULD SHE BE
ON A DIABETES DRUG?

00:38:24.870 --> 00:38:26.137
I DON'T THINK SHE KNEW
SHE WAS TAKING IT.

00:38:26.171 --> 00:38:27.539
I THINK
SHE WAS BEING POISONED.

00:38:27.573 --> 00:38:28.974
SOMEONE MUST HAVE BEEN
PUTTING IT IN HER FOOD,

00:38:29.007 --> 00:38:30.308
TRYING TO INDUCE
A HEART ATTACK.

00:38:30.342 --> 00:38:31.577
BUT SHE DIDN'T HAVE
A HEART ATTACK.

00:38:31.610 --> 00:38:33.479
BECAUSE SIDE EFFECTS
MANIFEST DIFFERENTLY

00:38:33.512 --> 00:38:34.946
IN DIFFERENT PATIENTS.

00:38:34.980 --> 00:38:36.715
LOW THIAMINE LEVELS
CAN CAUSE CARDIAC FAILURE,

00:38:36.748 --> 00:38:38.717
BUT IN RARE INSTANCES,
THEY CAN ALSO CAUSE...

00:38:38.750 --> 00:38:40.185
KORSAKOFF'S SYNDROME.

00:38:42.521 --> 00:38:43.789
WAIT.
SO WHO WAS POISONING HER?

00:38:47.759 --> 00:38:51.062
MS. NELSON?
I'M AGENT MORETTI, FBI.

00:38:51.096 --> 00:38:52.631
THIS IS DR. PIERCE.

00:38:52.664 --> 00:38:54.232
WOULD YOU MIND IF I ASKED YOU
A COUPLE QUESTIONS

00:38:54.265 --> 00:38:56.334
FOR OUR CASE
AGAINST DR. BRYANT?

00:38:56.368 --> 00:39:00.071
I STILL CAN'T BELIEVE
HE TRIED TO KILL ME.

00:39:00.105 --> 00:39:01.740
WELL, YOU FOUND OUT

00:39:01.773 --> 00:39:05.243
HE WAS TAMPERING
WITH THE INSULPRIN STUDY,

00:39:05.276 --> 00:39:07.012
SO YOU TOLD CLARK WEILMAN
ABOUT YOUR SUSPICIONS?

00:39:07.045 --> 00:39:09.581
I KNEW THAT DRUG
WAS GONNA HURT A LOT OF PEOPLE

00:39:09.615 --> 00:39:10.849
WHEN IT HIT THE MARKET.

00:39:10.882 --> 00:39:12.150
CLARK WAS A LAWYER.

00:39:12.183 --> 00:39:14.386
I-I FIGURED
HE'D KNOW WHAT TO DO.

00:39:14.420 --> 00:39:17.989
SO HE TOLD YOU
YOU NEEDED MORE EVIDENCE?

00:39:18.023 --> 00:39:19.958
THAT'S WHY YOU BROUGHT HIM
THE PILLS?

00:39:19.991 --> 00:39:22.794
CLARK DIDN'T WANT TO EXPOSE
THE COMPANY TO ANY LIABILITY

00:39:22.828 --> 00:39:24.129
UNLESS HE KNEW FOR SURE

00:39:24.162 --> 00:39:25.997
DR. BRYANT HAD DONE
SOMETHING WRONG.

00:39:26.031 --> 00:39:27.332
[ SCOFFS ]

00:39:27.365 --> 00:39:28.900
WHAT?

00:39:28.934 --> 00:39:31.169
IT'S JUST FUNNY YOU DIDN'T TELL
THE POLICE ANY OF THIS.

00:39:31.202 --> 00:39:33.539
T-THEY WANTED TO KNOW ABOUT
MY RELATIONSHIP WITH CLARK.

00:39:33.572 --> 00:39:35.774
I DIDN'T THINK IT HAD ANYTHING
TO DO WITH THE DRUG.

00:39:35.807 --> 00:39:36.975
OH, COME ON.

00:39:37.008 --> 00:39:38.276
YOU GAVE CLARK WEILMAN
THOSE PILLS

00:39:38.309 --> 00:39:40.045
SO HE COULD POISON
HIS WIFE, RIGHT?

00:39:40.078 --> 00:39:41.413
ARE YOU OUT OF YOUR MIND?

00:39:41.447 --> 00:39:42.614
WELL, THAT'S NOT
THE CLINICAL DESCRIPTION,

00:39:42.648 --> 00:39:44.049
BUT YES, ACTUALLY.

00:39:44.082 --> 00:39:46.718
AND POOR DR. BRYANT --
HE WAS OUT OF HIS MIND, TOO.

00:39:46.752 --> 00:39:48.654
HE WAS FEELING SO GUILTY
FOR WHAT HE'D DONE

00:39:48.687 --> 00:39:49.888
THAT HE BECAME PARANOID,

00:39:49.921 --> 00:39:51.389
AND HE MADE
THE SAME MISTAKE WE DID.

00:39:51.423 --> 00:39:53.625
HE ASSUMED THAT YOU'D STOLEN
THOSE PILLS AS EVIDENCE

00:39:53.659 --> 00:39:55.160
WHEN IN FACT YOU WERE SUPPLYING
CLARK WEILMAN

00:39:55.193 --> 00:39:56.294
WITH THE PERFECT
MURDER WEAPON.

00:39:56.327 --> 00:39:57.629
WHAT ARE YOU
TALKING ABOUT?

00:39:57.663 --> 00:39:59.197
THE DRUG WASN'T
ON THE MARKET YET,

00:39:59.230 --> 00:40:00.732
SO IT WAS
VIRTUALLY UNTRACEABLE.

00:40:00.766 --> 00:40:02.233
YOU MUST HAVE BEEN DOSING
PAMELA FOR WEEKS,

00:40:02.267 --> 00:40:03.635
JUST WAITING FOR HER HEART
TO GIVE OUT.

00:40:03.669 --> 00:40:05.571
I WAS TRYING TO DO
THE RIGHT THING.

00:40:05.604 --> 00:40:08.373
WHY ELSE WOULD I CALL THE C.E.O.
OF THE COMPANY

00:40:08.406 --> 00:40:10.876
AND TELL HIM
ABOUT THE FALSIFIED RESULTS?

00:40:10.909 --> 00:40:12.077
YOU WERE WORRIED
THAT PAMELA FOUND OUT

00:40:12.110 --> 00:40:13.812
HER HUSBAND
WAS POISONING HER.

00:40:13.845 --> 00:40:16.081
IF SHE WENT TO THE POLICE,
YOU WOULD NEED A COVER STORY

00:40:16.114 --> 00:40:17.415
TO EXPLAIN WHY YOU HAD GIVEN HIM
THE PILLS,

00:40:17.449 --> 00:40:19.585
SO YOU PRETENDED
TO BE A WHISTLE-BLOWER.

00:40:19.618 --> 00:40:21.653
NO.
THAT IS NOT RIGHT.

00:40:21.687 --> 00:40:23.321
NO, WHAT'S NOT RIGHT

00:40:23.354 --> 00:40:26.024
IS THAT PAMELA WEILMAN WAS
ACCUSED OF KILLING HER HUSBAND

00:40:26.057 --> 00:40:27.826
WHEN IN FACT
YOU AND YOUR BOYFRIEND

00:40:27.859 --> 00:40:29.861
WERE TRYING TO KILL HER.

00:40:34.766 --> 00:40:36.468
I WANT A LAWYER.

00:40:36.502 --> 00:40:38.203
GONNA NEED A GOOD ONE.

00:40:40.205 --> 00:40:42.508
Gerard:
NICE WORKING WITH YOU, DOC.

00:40:51.316 --> 00:40:53.819
[ KNOCK ON DOOR ]

00:40:55.386 --> 00:40:57.989
Karyn: YOU WANTED TO SEE ME,
PROFESSOR?

00:40:58.023 --> 00:41:01.593
KARYN, YES.
UH, COME IN, PLEASE.

00:41:01.627 --> 00:41:04.763
UM, I-I WANTED
TO APOLOGIZE

00:41:04.796 --> 00:41:07.265
FOR WHAT I SAID ON THE COMMON
THE OTHER DAY.

00:41:07.298 --> 00:41:08.867
IT WAS -- IT WAS,
UH, HIGHLY INAPPROPRIATE

00:41:08.900 --> 00:41:13.639
AND, UH, UH,
OFFENSIVE.

00:41:13.672 --> 00:41:15.507
AND VERY PERCEPTIVE.

00:41:18.544 --> 00:41:21.513
I'M SORRY MY FRIEND
WAS SUCH A [BLEEP]

00:41:21.547 --> 00:41:25.116
I TOLD HER NOT TO FILE
THAT COMPLAINT.

00:41:25.150 --> 00:41:30.722
OH, OH, UH, UH,
COULD YOU --

00:41:30.756 --> 00:41:33.491
COULD YOU JUST WAIT --
UH, WAIT HERE ONE SECOND?

00:41:35.160 --> 00:41:36.294
LEWICKI!

00:41:36.327 --> 00:41:38.029
W-WHAT IS IT, DOC?

00:41:38.063 --> 00:41:41.332
I NEED YOU TO TELL ME IF
THERE'S SOMEONE IN MY OFFICE.

00:41:45.436 --> 00:41:47.573
Karyn: HEY!

00:41:53.478 --> 00:41:55.480
THAT ONE
WAS DEFINITELY REAL.

00:41:57.949 --> 00:42:01.419
Daniel: LAST WEEK, I ASKED,
"WHAT IS REALITY?"

00:42:01.452 --> 00:42:06.324
THIS WEEK,
I WANT TO TALK ABOUT NORMALCY.

00:42:06.357 --> 00:42:09.060
WHAT IS NORMAL?

00:42:09.094 --> 00:42:13.565
IF YOU FEEL SAD, DO YOU JUST
HAVE A CASE OF THE BLUES,

00:42:13.599 --> 00:42:17.535
OR ARE YOU SUFFERING
FROM A NEUROCHEMICAL IMBALANCE?

00:42:19.705 --> 00:42:22.674
THE VAST MAJORITY
OF THE CASE STUDIES

00:42:22.708 --> 00:42:24.309
THAT WE'VE BEEN LOOKING AT

00:42:24.342 --> 00:42:26.812
INVOLVE PATIENTS WHOSE BRAINS
ARE ANYTHING BUT NORMAL,

00:42:26.845 --> 00:42:29.014
AND THERE'S NO QUESTION
THEY SUFFER.

00:42:29.047 --> 00:42:32.851
BUT...

00:42:32.884 --> 00:42:34.853
IS IT ALL BAD?

00:42:34.886 --> 00:42:38.189
FOR SOME,
THEIR NEUROLOGICAL STATES

00:42:38.223 --> 00:42:40.058
MIGHT ACTUALLY PROTECT THEM

00:42:40.091 --> 00:42:43.962
FROM PAINFUL TRUTHS THAT NO ONE
WOULD WANT TO THINK ABOUT.

00:42:43.995 --> 00:42:47.465
OTHERS DEVELOP
A-A CHEERFUL DISPOSITION

00:42:47.498 --> 00:42:49.534
THAT MAY HELP THEM COPE
WITH SITUATIONS

00:42:49.567 --> 00:42:51.569
THE REST OF US
WOULD FIND DISTURBING.

00:42:54.505 --> 00:42:57.743
AND IF WE ARE TO ESTABLISH
A BASELINE,

00:42:57.776 --> 00:42:59.745
THEN WE ALSO
HAVE TO ASK OURSELVES

00:42:59.778 --> 00:43:02.313
HOW THE BRAINS OF EVEN
SO-CALLED NORMAL PEOPLE

00:43:02.347 --> 00:43:05.751
RESPOND TO CERTAIN STIMULI.

00:43:19.364 --> 00:43:21.933
AND IF WE'RE ABLE TO
TREAT THOSE PEOPLE

00:43:21.967 --> 00:43:24.369
LIVING WITH
NEUROLOGICAL DISORDERS,

00:43:24.402 --> 00:43:28.874
RESTORE THEM TO --
QUOTE -- "NORMALCY,"

00:43:28.907 --> 00:43:31.877
WELL, OF COURSE
WE'RE HELPING THEM.

00:43:31.910 --> 00:43:36.014
BUT MIGHT WE SOMETIMES
ALSO BE STRIPPING AWAY

00:43:36.047 --> 00:43:38.283
WHAT MAKES THEM UNIQUE...

00:43:39.818 --> 00:43:44.455
...ROBBING THEM
OF AN ESSENTIAL PART

00:43:44.489 --> 00:43:47.192
OF WHO THEY ARE?

00:44:25.230 --> 00:44:27.733
[ CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYS ]